\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1093840/extras/36cb597a508517ff20d280443cc11333.poster.avif?t=1702506979\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1093840/extras/36cb597a508517ff20d280443cc11333.webm?t=1702506979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1093840/extras/36cb597a508517ff20d280443cc11333.mp4?t=1702506979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
