    "reviews": "\u201cDripping in the vibes of late night channel surfing insomnia... It's an irresistible aesthetic and it's pulled off beautifully.\u201d<br>Trevor Henderson<br><br>\u201cIt perfectly captures that 60's horror vibe, with some awesome claymation and a great sense of atmosphere. It's short, but well worth the time.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cLike Courage the Cowardly Dog meets The Twilight Zone\u201d<br>ManlyBadassHero<br>",
